---
import { SITE, SERVICES } from '../data/site';

const tel = SITE.phone;
const telHref = `tel:${SITE.phoneRaw}`;


const values = [
  ['Test before replacing', 'A code points at a circuit, not a part. We test the circuit before we quote the repair.'],
  ['Explain the options', 'Repair, recondition or replace, with the cost, turnaround and warranty for each.'],
  ['Quote in writing', 'The number you approve is the number you pay. No surprise add-ons at pickup.'],
  ['Keep it drivable', 'If the car is not safe to drive, we say so before you get back on the road.'],
];

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What kind of shop is Tip Top Hybrid?',
    a: 'We are an independent hybrid repair shop in Upland, California, focused on Toyota and Lexus hybrids and also servicing Honda, Ford and other hybrid models. Our work covers hybrid batteries, high-voltage systems, inverters, brake actuators, transaxles and engine replacement.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Are you a Toyota dealer?',
    a: 'No. We are independent. That means dealer-level diagnostic capability without dealer parts and labor pricing, and we can use new OEM, remanufactured or tested used parts depending on your budget and the job.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you work on hybrids other than the Prius?',
    a: 'Yes. We service Camry Hybrid, RAV4 Hybrid, Highlander Hybrid, Prius Prime, Lexus CT 200h, ES 300h and RX 450h, Honda Accord and Civic hybrids, and Ford Fusion and Escape hybrids.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Where do you service customers from?',
    a: 'Our shop is at 1894 W 9th St Ste B, Upland, CA 91786. Customers come from Upland, Montclair, Claremont, Pomona, Rancho Cucamonga, Ontario, Chino, San Bernardino, Riverside, Corona and the wider Inland Empire.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I get an estimate before I book?',
    a: 'Yes. Send the year, make, model and symptoms through the free estimate form or call 909-238-7028. If diagnosis is needed, we confirm that fee before the car is worked on.',
  },
];
const url = 'https://www.tiptophybrid.com/about-us/';
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'AboutPage',
      '@id': url,
      url,
      name: 'About Tip Top Hybrid',
      description: 'Independent hybrid repair shop in Upland, California, specializing in hybrid batteries, high-voltage systems, inverters, brake actuators and transaxles.',
      about: { '@id': 'https://www.tiptophybrid.com/#organization' },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'FAQPage',
      '@id': `${url}#faq`,
      mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: f.q, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a } })),
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      '@id': `${url}#breadcrumb`,
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://www.tiptophybrid.com/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About' },
      ],
    },
  ],
};
---

<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

<div class="service-page">
  <nav class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-6 text-sm text-slate-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <li><a class="hover:text-green-700" href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
      <li class="text-slate-700">About</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-center lg:py-14">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-green-700">About Tip Top Hybrid</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.8rem]">
        A hybrid shop, not a general garage
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        Tip Top Hybrid is an independent hybrid repair shop in Upland, California. We work on the systems that make a
        hybrid different: the traction battery, the high-voltage cables, the inverter, the brake actuator and the
        transaxle. It is the work a general shop often sends away.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[1.04rem] leading-[1.8] text-slate-700">
        The shop is run by Jay, a hybrid specialist customers mention by name in reviews for explaining the diagnosis
        and sticking to the quote. Most of our work comes from repeat customers and referrals across the Inland Empire.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href={telHref} class="rounded-lg bg-green-600 px-6 py-3 font-bold text-white hover:bg-green-700">Call {tel}</a>
        <a href="/free-estimate/" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:border-green-600 hover:text-green-700">Free estimate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img
      src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/prius-hood-up-1.jpeg"
      alt="Toyota Prius in the Tip Top Hybrid shop in Upland, California"
      width="900"
      height="600"
      class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-lg"
    />
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">Why we specialize</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[1.06rem] leading-[1.8] text-slate-700">
        Hybrids are not difficult because they are complicated to drive. They are difficult because the systems overlap.
        A brake warning can come from the actuator, a wheel-speed sensor or the hybrid control system. A no-start can be
        the 12V battery, the traction pack, the inverter or a relay. A coolant leak can be a hose, a water pump or a head
        gasket.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[1.06rem] leading-[1.8] text-slate-700">
        Specializing means we see those patterns often, we own the diagnostic tools to separate them, and we know which
        repair is worth doing on a 10-year-old car. It also means we can tell you when the honest answer is “this one
        can wait” or “this one is not worth fixing.”
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">How we work</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {values.map(([t, b], i) => (
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
          <span class="mb-3 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-100 text-sm font-bold text-green-700">{i + 1}</span>
          <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold text-slate-900">{t}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{b}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-14 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">What we work on</h2>
        <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {SERVICES.map((s) => (
            <li>
              <a href={s.href} class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-200 hover:text-green-400">
                <span class="mt-0.5 text-green-500">✓</span> {s.title}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">Where we work</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] text-slate-300">
          Our shop is in Upland, between the 10 and the 210. Customers come from Montclair, Claremont, Pomona,
          Rancho Cucamonga, Ontario, Chino, San Bernardino, Riverside, Corona and across the Inland Empire.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] text-slate-300">
          Inland heat is hard on hybrid batteries and inverters. We check cooling airflow and pack temperature as part
          of the diagnosis, because a repair that ignores heat will come back.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          1894 W 9th St Ste B, Upland, CA 91786 · <a class="font-semibold text-green-400" href={telHref}>{tel}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="mt-7 divide-y divide-slate-200">
      {faqs.map((f) => (
        <details class="group py-4">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-slate-900">
            <span>{f.q}</span>
            <span class="mt-1 flex-none text-green-600 transition group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] text-slate-600">{f.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-green-700">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-start gap-6 px-5 py-12 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">Talk to a hybrid specialist</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-green-50">Tell us the year, model and symptom. We will tell you what it likely needs and what it costs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-none flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href={telHref} class="rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-3 font-bold text-green-800">Call {tel}</a>
        <a href="/free-estimate/" class="rounded-lg border border-white/60 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10">Free estimate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
